      },
      "message": "feat(post): add G93 inverse-time feed solver and section mode markers\n\nEmit explicit `PARAM SectionMode` (`3-axis`, `3+2 indexed`,\n`simultaneous 5-axis`) markers per milling operation stream while\nleaving `post::dump`, legacy `.cl` inputs, and 3-axis `.nc` programs\nunchanged. Add the shared pure-Rust `G93` inverse-time feed solver in\n`camcraft_post::post::g93` (re-exported via `rotary_cap` and\n`kinematics`) handling part-space cutting chord duration, linear and\nrotary `max_normal_speed` ceilings, pure-rotary reorientations,\nzero-motion duplicate skipping, safe `F` clamping/formatting, and G20/G21\nunit invariance.\n\nFixes #1966",
